":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/extras/8dd76ad5b18b80d692f459a32f4a7fa4.avif?t=1759920885\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Home County\u00a0is a village-management game inspired by Edwardian Britain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Village Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each villager brings unique talents to help your community flourish. Watch your gardener harvesting flowers, your blacksmith crafting, or your artisan creating goods. Tend to your villager's needs and keep spirits high. Set up production lines to maximise your village's output.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Immersive Life Sim</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your days pursuing charming hobbies like painting, fishing, or mining. You might get dirty along the way, so be sure to take a wash in your tub! Unwind with the radio, or indulge in a restful nap. Live the relaxing countryside life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the Crystal Garden, and get to know a cast of 16 characters, each with their own personality, routines, and storylines. Venture into a mines filled with history, treasures, and adventure. Explore a world inspired by  Edwardian Britain. Will you become a Lord/Lady or lead your village as equals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Swanworth"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/cd12a24bdd5507d702da8d2476101655a9d4e155/header.jpg?t=1759920885","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul